@startuml
title Hannibal Protocol — suspicious outbound activity
participant "Sentry" as S
database "Event Journal" as J
participant "Threat Detection" as D
participant "Tactical ML" as M
participant "Threat Analysis" as A
participant "Overwatch" as O
participant "Containment Broker" as B
S -> J : append Process/Connection event
par independent consumers
  J -> D : event + evidence
  D -> J : DetectionFinding
else
  J -> M : 60s lineage feature window
  M -> J : AnomalyScore
else
  J -> A : process/file/network edge
  A -> J : GraphRelationship
end
J -> O : incident update + evidence
O -> O : scope check + protected target check
O -> O : corroboration and policy evaluation
alt policy permits temporary block
  O -> J : PolicyDecision(allow, ttl=900s)
  O -> B : scoped request with trusted authorization
  B -> B : recheck target + ACL + idempotency + signatures
  B -> J : ContainmentReceipt
else no permitted action
  O -> J : Alert or Observe
end
note over O,B
K-Means anomaly alone never authorizes containment.
end note
@enduml
